00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:40.160
work. The S&amp;P 500 closed at 7,743, up 0.5%. The NASDAQ composite reached 27,069, also

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:51.000
up 0.5%. The TSX composite finished at 35,801, up 0.3%. About 32 days ago are simulated

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:59.640
pick in png.v closed down 5.59%, reminding us that even strong earning surprises need volume

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:05.540
confirmation. Sentiment today draws from policy signals on interest rates and energy costs.

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:11.580
The Federal Reserve and Bank of Canada both face questions on whether to let growth run or tighten

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:17.600
into supply shocks. The nearest central bank decisions sit weeks away. With markets pricing in

